<div class="fcc-osa__text"><h2 class="fcc-osa__heading" id="fcc-osa-heading-template--22974334501083__fcc_org_sets_apart_MBpaby">What Sets <em>HiPP Organic Formula Apart</em> vs Other Brands</h2><div class="fcc-osa__intro"><p>Choosing the right formula is a big decision, and HiPP makes it easier by going well beyond standard organic requirements. We’ve highlighted the key factors that distinguish their formulas so you can feel confident in your choice.</p></div></div><div class="fcc-osa__list" id="fcc-osa-list-template--22974334501083__fcc_org_sets_apart_MBpaby"><details class="fcc-osa__item" open="">
<summary>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-osa__pill"></span>
<h3 class="fcc-osa__item-title">HiPP Organic Seal</h3>
</summary><div class="fcc-osa__body-row">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-osa__rule"></span>
<div class="fcc-osa__item-body"><p>HiPP works directly with its network of organic farms and holds its suppliers to standards that exceed both statutory and international requirements. Every product bearing the HiPP Organic Seal has passed some of the industry’s most rigorous residue checks. Parents can trust that what’s on the label reflects what’s in the tin.</p></div>
</div></details><details class="fcc-osa__item">
<summary>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-osa__pill"></span>
<h3 class="fcc-osa__item-title">Up to 260 Safety Checks Per Product</h3>
</summary><div class="fcc-osa__body-row">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-osa__rule"></span>
<div class="fcc-osa__item-body"><p>Every jar and tin of HiPP formula undergoes up to 260 individual safety checks, including tests by independent institutes. Few manufacturers in any food category can point to that level of scrutiny. For parents who want full confidence in what their baby consumes, it matters.</p></div>
</div></details></div></div>
</section>
