<div aria-labelledby="fcc-onp-tab-inc-template--22974334501083__hipp_3_new_mjg7Xc" class="fcc-onp__panel" id="fcc-onp-panel-inc-template--22974334501083__hipp_3_new_mjg7Xc" role="tabpanel"><h3 class="fcc-onp__subheading">What HiPP includes</h3><details class="fcc-onp__item" open="">
<summary>
<span>Organic Lactose</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>The primary carbohydrate source, mirroring the composition of breastmilk.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>Combiotic® Prebiotics and Probiotics</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>HiPP's proprietary blend of live cultures and prebiotic fibers supports a balanced gut microbiome and a developing immune system.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>DHA and ALA (Omega-3 and Omega-6 LCPs)</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>Long-chain polyunsaturated fatty acids that support brain development and visual acuity during the critical early months.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>Lactose-Derived Oligosaccharides</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>Naturally sourced prebiotic carbohydrates that feed beneficial gut bacteria and support healthy digestion.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>Essential Vitamins and Minerals</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>Each stage is fortified with a balanced profile of essential vitamins and minerals calibrated to infant developmental needs.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>Organic Skimmed Milk</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>The primary protein and calcium source, sourced from HiPP's network of certified organic farms.</p></div>
</details></div>
<div aria-labelledby="fcc-onp-tab-exc-template--22974334501083__hipp_3_new_mjg7Xc" class="fcc-onp__panel" hidden="" id="fcc-onp-panel-exc-template--22974334501083__hipp_3_new_mjg7Xc" role="tabpanel"><h3 class="fcc-onp__subheading">What HiPP excludes</h3><details class="fcc-onp__item" open="">
<summary>
<span>Corn Syrup and Added Sugars</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>No refined sugars are used. Lactose provides all necessary carbohydrates.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>GMOs</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>All ingredients comply with EU organic standards, which prohibit genetically modified organisms.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>Artificial Preservatives</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>HiPP relies on proper sealing and storage rather than chemical preservatives.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
<summary>
<span>Synthetic Colors and Flavors</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="fcc-onp__chev" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M2 5l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
</summary>
<div class="fcc-onp__answer"><p>Nothing artificial is added to alter the appearance or taste of the formula.</p></div>
</details><details class="fcc-onp__item">
